    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900604/2009006040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006040140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんの応援で、\r\nジャスティスレッドが復活しました！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900604/2009006040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、俺だけじゃなくて\r\nみんなの応援が力になったんだよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ヒーローショーってすごいな\r\n見てると、応援したいって気持ちが湧いてきて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006040150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんもそう思いますか！？\r\nあたしも、いっつも全力で応援しちゃうんです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900604/2009006040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。果穂の応援する元気な声、\r\n今でも耳に残ってるよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂の声は、きっとジャスティスレッドの\r\n力になっただろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006040160,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへへへ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900604/2009006040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006040170,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……あたしも、ステージに立ってる時\r\nみなさんの応援で強くなれます",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900604/2009006040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009006040180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だから……ジャスティスレッドに\r\nあたしの声が届いていたなら、うれしいです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900604/2009006040180"
  },
  {
    "select": "果穂は無敵だな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "だから果穂のエールは\r\n力強いのか",
    "nextLabel": "2"
